      "writtenOn": "2023-08-23T20:51:31Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Not sure what path is. But `KeySpec` is actually the \"key\" that can be used to find the value in the payload. It is will be a series of cbor_map keys for nested structures. The final `NodeConstraints` will be indexed by keyspec.\n\nKeySpec sounds about right to me, but I can change it to KeyPath if you htink that is more appropriate. Plz reopen the comment if so.",
